# The full 5,000,000-prompt export: ~2.5 GB, well past what git will take.
#
# It is not lost by being ignored. `export_prompts.py` regenerates it byte for
# byte from the seed in `corpus.py`, and the sample beside it is the same data at
# a size a reviewer can open. Committing the generator rather than the artefact is
# what makes the run checkable without making the repository unusable.
prompts.json
